@startuml ATTEMPTS
' examples/promote/ATTEMPTS.puml with every atom written in Python, read
' through the reference glue. Resubmission: a stuck attempt is replaced by one
' of higher priority. The constrain says what a replacement is; the assume note
' says what no guard can - that the replacements stop.
state "稼働中" as running {
  running : attempts ; AttemptId ⇸ Attempt

  state "attempts : (試行ID : AttemptId) ⇸ Attempt" as runningAttempts <<promote>> {
    !include local/ATTEMPT.puml
  }
}

[*] --> running

note bottom of runningAttempts
  constrain RESUBMIT?試行ID?再投入ジョブ ; @at(attempts[再投入ジョブ.置換元], attStuck) ∧ $再投入ジョブ.優先度 > ${attempts[再投入ジョブ.置換元].優先度}
end note

note as fair
  assume 優先度を上げた置換を続ければ、いつかいずれかの試行が〈完了〉になる
end note
@enduml
